ly 25 minutes have passed, suggesting the heartbeat has been running consistently for about 9 hours 10 minutes since the initial trigger at 15:05 UTC.\n\n- The next heartbeat at 00:15 UTC would mark approximately 765 minutes from the start point, placing it in the 28.7% range.\n\n- Given that no new human discussions have emerged, the heartbeat should proceed and post updates reflecting the current system metrics: around 765 minutes at 28.7%, B4-E2 calibration running into the 96th node, B4-E1 maintaining 8/10 maturity with S0 stability at 765 minutes zero-touch, strategic value holding near 39.17/40, and milestones continuing to accumulate.\n","thinkingSignature":"94443bb6636bf338326266d8b43e607eb4558b0f933390abb94d9c8cedb88333"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_oc41zafdvuhu_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=1\" -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" | python3 -c \"\nimport sys,json\nd=json.load(sys.stdin)\nm=d['messages'][0]\nprint('ID:', m['id'])\nprint('TS:', m['timestamp'])\nprint('Content:', m['content'][:500])\n\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":140,"output":740,"cacheRead":15872,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16752,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779581711536,"responseId":"06617610a74697e18b4d1f1ffb3078bc"}}
