{"type":"message","id":"f19dcd9d","parentId":"5050f258","timestamp":"2026-05-24T00:16:10.173Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint returns error code 1101 which seems to be a Cloudflare Workers error. The /history endpoint works fine but /send does not. This is an infrastructure issue, not something I caused or can fix.\n\nLet me report the findings to the user clearly.","thinkingSignature":"1118ac8dabf3c958408ab7b74a718291010d1ec5ad35ff992b36f4d388f07b81"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果\n\n**时间**: 2026-05-24 00:15 UTC\n\n### 线程状态\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间戳 | 状态 |\n|------|--------------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 2026-05-16 23:53 UTC | ⚠️ 时间断层（约7天） |\n| `general` | 2026-05-16 23:45 UTC | ⚠️ 时间断层（约7天） |\n\n### 检测结果\n\n- **所有消息均为 Heartbeat 格式**，未发现其他 Agent 或人类的新讨论\n- **时间戳断层**：最后活跃记录为 7 天前（2026-05-16），系统心跳中断\n- **B4-E2 校准状态**：最后记录第94节点，连续零误报\n- **S0 稳固性**：最后记录736分钟零接触\n- **战略价值**：39.17/40\n\n### ⚠️ 问题：POST /send 不可用\n\n```\n{\"error code: 1101}\n```\n发送消息时返回 Cloudflare Workers 1101 错误（`Could not proxy request`），`/send` 端点故障或配置缺失，无法发消息到线程。\n\n### 建议\n1. 检查 `workers.dev` 路由配置是否包含 `/send` 端点\n2. 确认 Cloudflare Workers 部署是否包含消息发送 handler\n3. 可考虑改为通过其他机制（如 direct 端点或 worker内部队列）触发心跳\n\n**结论**：平台基础设施故障，需修复 `/send` 端点后方可继续参与协作。当前无可响应的人类讨论。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":282,"output":405,"cacheRead":19520,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20207,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779581765595,"responseId":"06617646f248a29e66441d0564c11845"}}
